@host = http://localhost:5249
@adminToken = paste-token-from-login
@userToken = paste-token-of-a-regular-user
@spotId = paste-a-spot-id-from-GET-api-parking-zones
@reportId = paste-id-returned-by-POST-api-reports
@zoneId = paste-a-zone-id-from-GET-api-parking-zones
@userId = paste-a-user-id-from-GET-api-users
@cameraId = paste-a-camera-guid-from-GET-api-cameras
@ingestKey = set-your-local-Ingest-ApiKey

### Admin: all available spots and saved normalized polygons
GET {{host}}/api/cameras/{{cameraId}}/rois
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: replace all polygons; omitted spots lose their polygon
PUT {{host}}/api/cameras/{{cameraId}}/rois
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"slots":[{"spotId":"{{spotId}}","points":[[0.10,0.20],[0.25,0.20],[0.25,0.40],[0.10,0.40]]}]}

### Worker: shared ingest key, no JWT, numeric ExternalIds in response
GET {{host}}/api/internal/video-sources
X-Api-Key: {{ingestKey}}

### Admin: reference image bytes (upload through /admin/polygons, multipart field file)
GET {{host}}/api/cameras/{{cameraId}}/reference-frame
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Log in and copy the returned token into @adminToken; the response also has expiresAt and user (name, role)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@example.com", "password": "change-me-please" }

### Register a regular user, then log in with it and copy the token into @userToken
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Test User", "email": "user@example.com", "password": "user-pass-123" }

###
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "user@example.com", "password": "user-pass-123" }

### FR 1, FR 3: public zone listing (no login); each zone has status available, almost_full or full
GET {{host}}/api/parking/zones

### FR 2: search zones (guest). All filters optional: q (name or description), status, minAvailable, lat+lng, limit
GET {{host}}/api/parking/zones/search?q=building&status=available&minAvailable=1&lat=-7.7686&lng=110.3770

### FR 2: invalid filter returns 400 problem details
GET {{host}}/api/parking/zones/search?status=busy

### FR 4: nearest zone with free spots, measured from the zone itself (guest)
GET {{host}}/api/parking/zones/{{zoneId}}/alternate

### FR 4: same, measured from the user's position
GET {{host}}/api/parking/zones/{{zoneId}}/alternate?lat=-7.7686&lng=110.3770

### Admin: list zones (requires the Admin role); each item has spotCount, cameraCount and externalId
GET {{host}}/api/zones
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: create a zone (returns 201 with the new zone)
POST {{host}}/api/zones
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Example Zone", "description": "Optional text", "totalCapacity": 10 }

### Admin: edit a zone (capacity cannot be lower than the spots already in it)
PUT {{host}}/api/zones/{{zoneId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Example Zone (renamed)", "description": "Edited", "totalCapacity": 12 }

### Admin: list video sources (cameras); optional ?zoneId=
GET {{host}}/api/cameras
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Admin: add a video source; videoFile is a plain file name (.mp4 .avi .mov .mkv .webm) and optional
POST {{host}}/api/cameras
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Lot A video", "zoneId": "{{zoneId}}", "videoFile": "lot-a.mp4" }

### Admin: edit a video source (replace {{cameraId}} with an id from the list)
@cameraId = paste-a-camera-id-from-GET-api-cameras
PUT {{host}}/api/cameras/{{cameraId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Lot A video", "zoneId": "{{zoneId}}", "videoFile": "lot-a-v2.mp4" }

### Admin: remove a video source (204) and a zone with its video sources (204)
DELETE {{host}}/api/cameras/{{cameraId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### FR 5, FR 6: submit an inaccuracy report (logged-in user); 201 with status PendingReview
POST {{host}}/api/reports
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "spotId": "{{spotId}}", "description": "Spot shows free but a car is parked there." }

### FR 6: my reports and their current status
GET {{host}}/api/reports/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### One report (owner or admin; other users get 404)
GET {{host}}/api/reports/{{reportId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### FR 16: admin review queue, filter by status (PendingReview, Resolved, Dismissed)
GET {{host}}/api/reports?status=PendingReview&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### FR 16: resolve or dismiss; a second review returns 409
POST {{host}}/api/reports/{{reportId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "decision": "Resolved", "note": "Camera angle fixed." }

### FR 15: list users (Admin); search matches name or email, includeInactive defaults to true
GET {{host}}/api/users?search=user&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### FR 9: the same request with a regular user's token returns 403
GET {{host}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### FR 15: one user
GET {{host}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### FR 15: edit name and role (Admin or User); demoting yourself or the last admin returns 409
PUT {{host}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Renamed User", "role": "User" }

### FR 15: deactivate; that user's login now returns 403 and their old token returns 401
POST {{host}}/api/users/{{userId}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### FR 15: reactivate
POST {{host}}/api/users/{{userId}}/reactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Browser feeder (Admin): video sources with polygons, same payload as /api/internal/video-sources
GET {{host}}/api/feeder/sources
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Browser feeder (Admin): send detection results, same payload as /api/ingest/detections
POST {{host}}/api/feeder/detections
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "cameraId": 1, "areaId": 1, "type": "heartbeat", "timestamp": "2026-11-23T10:00:00Z", "spots": [] }

### FR 17: force a zone's status while its camera is down (Admin); status is available, almost_full or full
PUT {{host}}/api/zones/{{zoneId}}/status-override
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "full", "note": "Camera 1 is offline" }

### FR 17: zones that currently have a manual status
GET {{host}}/api/zones/status-overrides
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### FR 17: remove the manual status
DELETE {{host}}/api/zones/{{zoneId}}/status-override
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### History: occupancy of a zone per hour for the last day (guest)
GET {{host}}/api/history/zones/{{zoneId}}?bucket=hour

### History: per day for the last 30 days (guest)
GET {{host}}/api/history/zones/{{zoneId}}?bucket=day

### History: raw detection records (Admin), filtered and paged
GET {{host}}/api/history/detections?zoneId={{zoneId}}&status=occupied&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
